  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Educate a Child for a year in Kumba-Cameroon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">With no access to education and, the economic situation of inhabitants in many rural communities in Kake-Cameroon. As a result of the about seven years conflict in the North West &amp; South West Regions, hundreds even thousands of Children especially in  remote areas can no go to school. Your generous support and donations will enable us assist the most vulnerable children back to school. We have registered about 235 of them this year for the project.</narrative>
  </description>
